extends ui_layout

block styles
  link(type='text/css', rel='stylesheet', href='/public/css/com.css')

block content
  .sixteen.wide.column.centered#com
    .ui.card
      .com-header
        h1 Introducing Community Assistant
      .com-content
        p As part of your FreshView experience, you'll have access to a beta feature — an <strong>AI community assistant</strong> that can identify potentially harmful content and support you in crafting a thoughtful response when needed.
        h3.left-align How It Works
        p When the platform detects potentially harmful content, a chatbox will appear inviting you to engage with the community assistant. You can <strong>share draft comments, ask for suggestions, or talk through any concerns</strong> with the assistant. Engage with the assistant as much as you'd like, and you're always free to respond however you see fit.
        p We are actively testing this feature and would love to see how it works for you. 
        p When you're ready, press <strong>Enter Feed</strong> to start engaging with our community.
      .com-footer
        .com-footer-content
          img.com-logo(src='/public/favicon.svg', alt='FreshView Logo')
          .com-enter
            a.ui.large.primary.button(href='/') Enter Feed
